1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,149
Prism Desk.

2
00:00:01,149 --> 00:00:04,780
A daily light puzzle that lives on your real desk.

3
00:00:05,680 --> 00:00:07,708
Put on your Quest and sit down.

4
00:00:07,708 --> 00:00:15,102
Prism Desk finds the table in front of you, and sets a small puzzle board within easy reach, about two feet away.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,002
No controllers, and no wall of text.

6
00:00:18,002 --> 00:00:20,116
A glowing ring marks the first mirror.

7
00:00:20,116 --> 00:00:23,675
Touch it with your fingertip, and the light reaches the crystal.

8
00:00:24,570 --> 00:00:25,848
Mirror out of reach?

9
00:00:25,848 --> 00:00:27,510
Point your hand and pinch.

10
00:00:27,510 --> 00:00:30,770
The second lesson teaches the pinch ray in seconds.

11
00:00:31,670 --> 00:00:33,497
Then the real game begins.

12
00:00:33,497 --> 00:00:39,962
Every day brings three new puzzles, generated from the date, so everyone plays the same set.

13
00:00:39,962 --> 00:00:43,826
A solver checks each one, so there is always an answer.

14
00:00:44,730 --> 00:00:48,148
When the beam misses, the light doesn't stop at the board.

15
00:00:48,148 --> 00:00:51,389
It spills into your room, and lands on your real walls.

16
00:00:52,290 --> 00:00:55,562
Prism Desk is designed for seated, one-handed play.

17
00:00:55,562 --> 00:00:58,834
Dwell mode selects a mirror when you hold your aim.

18
00:00:58,834 --> 00:00:59,860
No pinch needed.

19
00:01:00,760 --> 00:01:07,703
High contrast mode keeps every tile and beam easy to read, and the control dock can swap to either side.

20
00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:11,851
Finish the day, and a new crystal grows in your garden.

21
00:01:12,750 --> 00:01:16,165
Come back tomorrow to keep your streak and grow the garden.

22
00:01:16,165 --> 00:01:18,770
This is a demo save with three weeks of play.

23
00:01:19,670 --> 00:01:21,825
Spatial anchors remember your desk.

24
00:01:21,825 --> 00:01:25,458
Leave, come back, and the board is right where you left it.

25
00:01:26,360 --> 00:01:27,178
Prism Desk.

26
00:01:27,178 --> 00:01:29,631
Built with the Immersive Web SDK.

27
00:01:29,631 --> 00:01:32,456
Play it now in the Meta Quest Browser.

